13:["$","p",null,{"children":["这是留学生报税最容易搞混的地方。普通的年度标准扣除额 (Standard Deduction, 2024 年约为 $14,600) ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"仅限 Resident Alien (RA)"}],"。 作为 NRA，你通常不能使用 Standard Deduction，但你可以使用 Tax Treaty。这也是为什么用对软件（如 Sprintax）如此重要的原因。"]}]
14:["$","div",null,{"className":"relative left-1/2 right-1/2 -mx-[50vw] w-screen sm:static sm:mx-auto sm:w-[50vw] my-12 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-brand-pink/20 shadow-xl bg-white","children":["$","$Ld",null,{"src":"/images/tax-treaty-vs-std-deduction.png","alt":"F1/OPT 留学生中美税收协定与标准扣除额对比图","width":1200,"height":800,"className":"w-full h-auto m-0","sizes":"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 50vw"}]}]
15:["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-brand-ink mt-10 mb-4","children":"为什么 F1/OPT 身份通常只能用 Treaty？"}]
16:["$","p",null,{"children":"IRS 规定，NRA 身份（无 1040 资格）不能享受 Standard Deduction。如果你在 TurboTax 里看到自己拿到了 $14k+ 的减免，那很可能你的身份报成 Resident 了，这将导致严重的身份合规风险。相反，$5,000 Treaty 是你作为 NRA 的合法减免权利。"}]
17:["$","h2",null,{"id":"how-to-apply","className":"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-brand-ink mt-16 mb-6 border-b-2 border-brand-pink/20 pb-2","children":"手把手教你实操：如何在税表中体现这 $5000？"}]
18:["$","p",null,{"children":"在 1040-NR 的申报流程中，你不能直接把收入减去 5000。你需要通过一个特定的表格来向 IRS 声明你的权利。"}]
19:["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-brand-ink mt-10 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"w-1.5 h-6 bg-brand-pinkdeep rounded-full"}],"关键表格：Form 8833 的填写要点"]}]
1a:["$","p",null,{"children":"Form 8833 是“披露披露受条约保护的返还头寸”的表格（Treaty-Based Return Position Disclosure）。"}]
1b:["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Item 1:"}]," 填上 \"The People's Republic of China\"。"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Article & Paragraph:"}]," 填上 \"Article 20(c)\"。"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Explanation:"}]," 简述你作为 F-1 学生申请 $5,000 的学费/培训费用免税。"]}]]}]
1c:["$","h2",null,{"children":"常见误区：H1B 之后还能继续用这个 $5000 吗？"}]
1d:["$","p",null,{"children":["答案通常是：",["$","strong",null,{"children":"不行"}],"。Article 20 主要是针对“学生 (Students) 和 培训人员 (Trainees)”。一旦你转为 H1B 变成正式员工，或者你已经在美超过 5 年通过 SPT 变成了 RA，你就不再符合 Article 20(c) 的“临时在美国从事研究/教育”的初心，也就失去了继续申请这 $5,000 的资格。"]}]
1e:["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-brand-ink mt-16 mb-6 border-b-2 border-brand-pink/20 pb-2","children":"FAQ: 漏报了去年的 Treaty 免税额，现在还能追回吗？"}]
1f:["$","p",null,{"children":"可以。如果你翻看去年的税表，发现没有见到 $5,000 的减免项目，你可以提交 1040-X 主动申请退还多缴的税款。这对于很多刚开始报税不了解政策的同学来说，是一笔“意外之财”。"}]
